OL,3,GNEWSAI'm leaving the BBC after MS pain
OL,4,Amade it hard to carry on
OL,5,
OL,6,FThanks to my neurologist and the NHS
OL,7,Fteam looking after me, I've managed to
OL,8,Fregain my speech and reduce the amount
OL,9,Fof discomfort I'm in - but the pain
OL,10,Fcan, and does, reappear.
